#: src/abilities/Toggle_Gcm_Ability.php:59
msgid "Enables or disables Google Consent Mode v2. GCM v2 is required for Google Ads and Analytics in the EU/EEA and is enabled by default. Only disable if explicitly requested by the user."
msgstr "Activa ou desactiva Google Consent Mode v2. GCM v2 é necesario para Google Ads e Analytics na UE/EEE e está activado por defecto. Desactívao só se o usuario o solicita de forma explícita."

#: src/abilities/Set_Cbid_Ability.php:101
msgid "Invalid ID. Provide a Cookiebot Domain Group ID (UUID: XXXXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXX) or a Usercentrics Settings ID (9 or 14 alphanumeric characters)."
msgstr "ID non válido. Indica un ID de grupo de dominios de Cookiebot (UUID: XXXXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXX) ou un ID de axustes de Usercentrics (9 ou 14 caracteres alfanuméricos)."

#: src/abilities/Set_Cbid_Ability.php:63
msgid "Sets the Domain Group ID (CBID). For Cookiebot accounts this is a UUID (XXXXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXX) found under Implementation in the Cookiebot Admin. For Usercentrics accounts this is a Settings ID (9 or 14 characters) found in the Usercentrics Admin. Changes take effect immediately."
msgstr "Establece o ID do grupo de dominios (CBID). Para as contas de Cookiebot é un UUID (XXXXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXX) que se atopa en Implementation no administrador de Cookiebot. Para as contas de Usercentrics é un ID de axustes (9 ou 14 caracteres) que se atopa no administrador de Usercentrics. Os cambios aplícanse de inmediato."

